GTNH-SmallAddons

Small GTNH addons.

build --> ./gradlew build

Linked Input Hatch
shared --> 4 x 64,000 L tanks by channel
private --> owner-only channel
circuit --> local per hatch
data stick --> left-click copy / right-click paste
screwdriver --> filter / sneak sorting

CRIB Wildcard Patterns
pattern --> same-material GregTech inputs/outputs expand across valid unifiable materials
toggle --> wildcard button or sneak + right-click Soft Mallet

AE2 Interface Wildcard Patterns
pattern --> same wildcard expansion for AE2 Interfaces
toggle --> sneak + right-click Soft Mallet

CRIB Non-Consumable Inputs
NC --> reserved reusable processing-pattern catalyst
mark --> shift + right-click pattern input
requires --> NC item in ME storage
result --> reserved once, not consumed, returned after craft
wildcard + NC --> supported
